WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.864
In tutorial 6.7, you'll read a
written page before you publish it,

00:00:10.914 --> 00:00:13.036
and take everything you
need to put it live.

00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:16.757
First, open the report of a written page.

00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:19.308
The top tells you if it
passed the quality check.

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:25.207
Scroll down to The page. Preview shows
it the way your readers will see it,

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:30.596
with a spot for each image. Click Copy
HTML to paste it into your website.

00:00:31.595 --> 00:00:37.195
Switch to HTML, or to Markdown, plain
text with simple marks for headings.

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:41.070
Meta holds the page details,
like its title and description,

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.822
and Copy meta.json copies them.

00:00:44.851 --> 00:00:48.551
Meta starts with the author
and reviewer named on the page.

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:51.876
The publishing checklist lists
what to do as you publish it,

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.963
and the outline shows its headings.

00:00:54.937 --> 00:00:58.312
Then check the image plan,
the links to your own pages,

00:00:58.362 --> 00:01:01.412
and how it looks when
shared on social media.

00:01:01.462 --> 00:01:05.137
Sources lists what the page cites,
and Secondary keywords used,

00:01:05.187 --> 00:01:06.890
the other searches it covers.

00:01:07.885 --> 00:01:13.085
Need the files? Downloads, at the
top, gives you the page as PDF, Word,

00:01:13.135 --> 00:01:15.828
HTML and Markdown, with its images.

00:01:16.812 --> 00:01:20.917
If a page misses the mark, click Not
what I wanted, say what was wrong,

00:01:20.967 --> 00:01:22.083
and click Mark it.

00:01:24.837 --> 00:01:30.262
Alaventra takes your reason into account.
If pages it chose on its own keep missing,

00:01:30.312 --> 00:01:32.243
it writes only for your keywords.

00:01:33.252 --> 00:01:37.722
So, read the preview, switch tabs, go
through the checklist, check images,

00:01:37.772 --> 00:01:41.577
links and sources, download the
files, and say what was wrong.

00:01:42.561 --> 00:01:48.669
Your page is ready to go live. Next, read
your website overview, in tutorial 7.1.
